Committed so //go:embed all:dist in web/embed.go always has a directory to
embed — go:embed fails the build on a missing or empty directory, and web/dist
is a gitignored build artifact.

A real build (pnpm --dir web/frontend build) fills this directory. web.DistFS()
reports "not built" when index.html is absent here and the server falls back to
reading web/dist off disk.
